  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> is equal to :&nbsp;</p>"
  },
